# MISCHIEF MOVE: side-view movement. The fox in profile, always facing LEFT (the engine mirrors it).
# Same character as base.pet 'sit': k outline, orange o fur with O shade low/behind, a little y on the
# skull, cream w jaw/throat/chest/paws/tail tip, one 1x2 e eye, k nose at the snout tip, a tall near
# ear with its w inner pixel under the tip and the far ear 1 px behind it in O. Drawn in place: body
# centre ~cols 7-8, bushy tail out to the right (cols 10-15) with a k-closed cream tip, ground row 15.
# See art/pet/SPEC.md.

# Dash cycle (0.07 s/frame, loops). Extended frames touch the ground (paws row 14, outline row 15);
# gathered frames lift the body and head 1 px, legs tucked, tail bobs 1 px down. Ears laid back.
# run_1: fully extended, all four legs splayed diagonally.
@frame run_1
................
................
......k.........
....kkok........
...kwokOk.......
..koookOk...kk..
..koyyook..kook.
.kooeoookkkooowk
koooeoowooooowwk
.kwwwwwooooOOwwk
..kwwwwoooooOWk.
...kkwwOOOOook..
...kokOkkkOkok..
..kokOk...kOkok.
.kwkWk.....kWkwk
..k.k.......k.k.

